 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.4.1-rc1 — Launch polish
+
+- Split the UnderWeb workspace into Command, OSC Lab, People, and System panels.
+- Reduced visual noise and made live lobby operations the primary hierarchy.
+- Added clear Group Recruiter safety-state chips and safer manual confirmation.
+- Manual group recruitment now shows the eligible count before sending.
+- Refined OSC Lab presets and added a 144-character live usage meter.
+- Clarified launch-safe copy, privacy boundaries, and approved-group automation wording.
+
 ## 0.3.0
 
 - Added UnderWeb network-manifest integration with cached/offline fallback.
@@ -41,3 +50,13 @@
 - Added **Group Recruiter**: invites eligible occupants already inside the current approved VRChat group instance into that VRChat group.
 - Renamed the previous friend-to-instance automation to **Instance Inviter** so the two behaviors are distinct.
 - Group Recruiter is opt-in, dwell-gated, paced, deduped per user/group for 24 hours, stops on instance changes, disarms on permission errors, and backs off on rate limits.
+
+## 0.4.0 - Launch feature freeze candidate
+
+- Added native OSC Lab with VRChat chatbox output and avatar parameter testing.
+- Added Pulsoid real-time heart-rate connection with HR/isHRBeat avatar parameter output.
+- Added chatbox composer presets, priority trimming, event/world/music/heart-rate blocks.
+- Added privacy/safety controls and one-click disarm for recruiter, instance inviter, and OSC.
+- Kept Group Recruiter safeguards, including mandatory current-group membership verification before inviting.
+- Retained Connected Accounts, role-aware Radar, Event Mode, notifications, update checking, and activity log.
+- Renamed old Auto Invite references to Instance Inviter where visible.
